# agent worktrees, never tracked
.claude/worktrees/

# a bare `go build ./cmd/...` drops the executable here
/truenas-csi
site/

# procoder's machine-generated working data. The code index alone is ~24 MB and
# is rebuilt from source by `procoder index build`, so committing it adds
# nothing a checkout cannot regenerate and everything a clone has to download.
.procoder/index/
.procoder/state/
.lycheecache

# procoder writes this when it has questions for a human. It quotes decisions
# verbatim, and its `Key:` identity hashes read as generic API keys to a secret
# scanner. It is a working file handed back with `procoder ask --file`, not
# something to track.
.procoder/ask/QA.md
